            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Kipowi 0.5.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Check for Updates is now available in the Kipowi menu.</li>
<li>Choose whether to check automatically in Settings → Updates.</li>
<li>See what changed before choosing to download and install an update.</li>
<li>Update downloads and the update feed are cryptographically verified.</li>
</ul>
<p>Includes precise frame stepping, the stable frame counter, rotation and flips, and multiple selections from Kipowi 0.5.0.</p>
